 328020/
CREATED:20260831T175406Z
DESCRIPTION:Bring your wildest ideas to life at our BASH Science Fair: Mad 
 Scientist Edition 🧪⚡ Kids and teens can design an experiment\, build a con
 traption\, or share a favorite science obsession with our homeschooling com
 munity.\n🧫🧬🔬⚗️🔭🥼🧪🧑‍🔬👩‍🔬\nThis event celebrates curiosity\, creati
 vity\, and hands-on learning. All comfort levels are welcome—from first-tim
 e experimenters to seasoned tinkerers. Sign up here to share your project\,
  help out\, or just let us know you’re coming.\n🚨Zeffy Registration Requir
 ed⬇️🚨\nhttps://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/bash-science-fair-mad-scienti
 st-edition\n\n•Upon registration I will email you the PDF information on wh
 at is required of your Science Fair Project Display Board in order to quali
 fy for 1st\, 2nd\, 3rd\, 4th or 5th place trophy or to receive your BASH Ma
 d Scientist Participation Award! \n•Registration ends on Oct 17th! 
LAST-MODIFIED:20260831T175406Z
LOCATION:Bob Briscoe Park
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:BASH Science Fair: Mad Scientist Edition
