CREATED:20260831T175244Z
DESCRIPTION:Join BASH for an incredible field trip to the Houston interacti
 ve aquarium. There is such a big variety of animals here\, such an amazing 
 learning experience and so much fun for all!\nIt will be $10 per child\, an
 d $26 for parents. BUTTT\, teachers and first responders are free\, and yes
  homeschool teachers count :) so please make yourself a homeschool ID\, if 
 you need help with that please reach out to an admin\, we will be happy to 
 assist ❤️ you HAVE to have your homeschool ID to receive the free admission
 . \nBring a lunch\, I will have a couple coolers you can use :)\nPlease arr
 ive at least 10 mins early\, we have to be on time to stay on schedule 🙏 \
 n\nWe will post a zeffy link for you to pay :) \nDon’t forget your BASH fie
 ld trip shirt! 💚\n\nIncludes Stingray Feeding\nAviary Visit\nEducational T
 alk\nPetting Zoo\, \nLemur Encounter (4th grade or higher age)
