URL:https://facebook.com/events/s/galveston-railroad-museum-fiel/1675439527
 083497/
CREATED:20260831T175605Z
DESCRIPTION:🚂 BASH Field Trip: Galveston Railroad Museum 🚂\n\nAll aboard!
  Join us for a fun\, hands-on day exploring one of Galveston’s most unique 
 museums. Kids and adults can climb aboard historic railcars\, explore locom
 otives\, see interactive exhibits\, and learn how railroads helped shape Te
 xas and the nation. It’s a great trip for train lovers and curious explorer
 s alike!\n\nAdmission:\n🎟️ Ages 3 & up: $8\n🎟️ Adults: $13\n🇺🇸 Veterans
 : FREE\n🍎 Teachers: FREE (please bring your homeschool ID)\n\nThe museum f
 eatures historic train cars\, model train displays\, railroad artifacts\, i
 nteractive exhibits\, and opportunities to step inside many of the restored
  railcars. It’s an educational experience that’s fun for the whole family. 
 (galvestonrrmuseum.org⁠￼)\n\nWe can’t wait to explore the rails with everyo
 ne! 🚂\n\n(We will post a zeffy link for payment when the event gets closer
  🙏)
LAST-MODIFIED:20260831T175606Z
LOCATION:Galveston Railroad Museum
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Galveston railroad museum field trip. 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
