URL:https://facebook.com/events/s/green-thumb-tuesday-jimbos-nur/1300997748
 476062/
CREATED:20260831T175411Z
DESCRIPTION:Let’s go garden! 🪴 \nJoin us at Jimbos nursery as Mrs. Claire 
 will be teaching us to make Kokedama. \n\nKokedama (pronounced koh-keh-DAH-
 mah) is a Japanese gardening art form whose name means “moss ball.” Instead
  of growing a plant in a pot\, the plant’s roots are wrapped in a ball of s
 oil that’s covered in moss and secured with string or fishing line.\n\nEach
  participant is $10 \nPlease comment on the headcount post only if you are 
 for sure going\, class caps at 20 kids. \nYou’ll pay the nursery after we’r
 e done ❤️ \nThis is an amazing nursery\, so many great plants and all very 
 reasonable if you’d like to shop around afterwards :) 
LAST-MODIFIED:20260831T175411Z
LOCATION:Jimbo’s Nursery
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Green thumb Tuesday: Jimbos nursery 🪴 
