CREATED:20260831T175236Z
DESCRIPTION:🌻 BASH SWAP & SHARE 🌻\n📅 September 15 • 10:00 AM\n💛 Everyth
 ing is completely FREE!\n\nClean out those closets\, playrooms\, bookshelve
 s\, homeschool cabinets\, and garages! Bring things your family has outgrow
 n or no longer needs and let them find a new home with another family. ♻️💚
 \n\nThis is NOT a sale and you do not have to trade item-for-item.\n\n✨ Bri
 ng what you can. Take what you need. Everything is FREE. ✨\n\nWHAT CAN YOU 
 BRING?\n👕 Kids’ & adult clothing\n👟 Shoes & accessories\n🧸 Toys & games\
 n📚 Books & homeschool supplies\n👶 Baby & toddler items\n⚽ Sports & outdoo
 r gear\n🎨 Arts & crafts supplies\n🏠 Household items\n🎄 Seasonal items & 
 décor\n…and other clean\, useful items another family may enjoy!\n\n🌼 HOW 
 IT WORKS\nBring your items and place them in the appropriate Swap & Share a
 rea. Once everything is set up\, everyone can browse and take home things t
 heir family can use.\n\nThere are no prices\, no money\, and no item-for-it
 em trades.\n\nAnd YES—you can come even if you don’t have anything to bring
 ! You do not have to donate something in order to take something. ❤️\n\n🧡 
 KIDS’ PLAY AREA!\nWe’ll have a special kids’ area with Play-Doh and supplie
 s to create and play while families browse the Swap & Share!\n\n🌿 A FEW SI
 MPLE RULES\n• Everything must be 100% FREE—no selling or soliciting.\n• Onl
 y bring items that are clean\, safe\, and usable.\n• Please do not bring br
 oken\, heavily damaged\, expired\, or recalled items.\n• Bring only items y
 ou are ready to part with permanently.\n• Be considerate while browsing so 
 everyone gets a chance to find something they can use.\n• Parents are respo
 nsible for supervising their children.\n\n♻️ NO NEED TO TAKE YOUR LEFTOVERS
  HOME!\n\nAnything remaining after the Swap & Share will be kept by our won
 derful host venue and made available to their members\, so your donations c
 an continue helping families even after our event is over. 💚\n\n💛 You don
 ’t have to give to receive\, and you don’t have to receive to give.\n\nCome
  declutter\, find some new-to-you treasures\, meet other BASH families\, an
 d help us keep perfectly good things in our community and out of the landfi
 ll! ♻️
LAST-MODIFIED:20260831T175236Z
LOCATION:14550 Hwy 3 Webster TX 77062
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:BASH Swap & Share 💕
